      "3": "Empero Dios [H430] vino [H935] a Abimelech [H40] en sueños [H2472] de noche [H3915], y le [H1931] dijo [H559]: He aqui [H2009] muerto [H4191] eres a causa de la mujer [H802] que [H834] has tomado [H3947], la cual [H1931] es casada [H1167] con marido [H1166].",
