      "17": "Entonces Abraham [H85] oro [H6419] a Dios [H430]; y Dios [H430] sano [H7495] a Abimelech [H40] y a su mujer [H802], y a sus siervas [H519], y parieron [H3205].",
      "18": "Porque [H3588] habia del todo [H6113] cerrado [H6113] Jehova [H3068] toda [H3605] matriz [H7358] de la casa [H1004] de Abimelech [H40], a causa [H1697] de Sara [H8283] mujer [H802] de Abraham [H85]. "
