      "3": "Y dijo [H559] Jose [H3130] a sus hermanos [H251]: Yo [H589] soy Jose [H3130]: ¿vive [H2416] aun [H5750] mi [H589] padre [H1]? Y sus hermanos [H251] no [H3808] pudieron [H3201] responderle [H6030], porque [H3588] estaban turbados [H926] delante [H6440] de el.",
