      "7": "De Juda [H3063], Naason [H5177] hijo [H1121] de Aminadab [H5992].",
      "8": "De Issachâr [H3485], Nathanael [H5417] hijo [H1121] de Suar [H6686].",
      "9": "De Zabulon [H2074], Eliab [H446] hijo [H1121] de Helon [H2497].",
      "10": "De los hijos [H1121] de Jose [H3130]: de Ephraim [H669], Elisama [H476] hijo [H1121] de Ammiud [H5989]; de Manases [H4519], Gamaliel [H1583] hijo [H1121] de Pedasur [H6301].",
