      "5": "Mas no [H3808] quiso [H14] Jehova [H3068] tu Dios [H430] oir a Balaam [H1109]; y Jehova [H3068] tu Dios [H430] te volvio la maldicion [H7045] en bendicion [H1293], porque [H3588] Jehova [H3068] tu Dios [H430] te amaba [H157].",
