      "5": "Y señoreaba en el monte [H2022] de Hermon [H2768], y en Salca [H5548], y en todo [H3605] Basan [H1316] hasta [H5704] los terminos [H1366] de Gessuri [H1651] y de Maachâti [H4602], y la mitad [H2677] de Galaad [H1568], termino [H1366] de Sehon [H5511] rey [H4428] de Hesbon [H2809].",
      "6": "A estos hirieron [H5221] Moises [H4872] siervo [H5650] de Jehova [H3068] y los hijos [H1121] de Israel [H3478]; y Moises [H4872] siervo [H5650] de Jehova [H3068] dio [H5414] aquella tierra en posesion [H3425] a los Rubenitas [H7206], Gaditas [H1425], y a la media [H2677] tribu [H7626] de Manases [H4519].",
