      "17": "Hesbon [H2809], con todas [H3605] sus villas [H5892] que [H834] estan en la llanura [H4334]; Dibon [H1769], y Bamoth-baal [H1120], y Beth-baal [H1120]-meon [H1010];",
      "18": "Y Jaas [H3096], y Keddemoth [H6932], y Mephaath [H4158],",
      "19": "Y Chîriataim [H7156], y Sibma [H7643], y Zerethshahar [H6890] en el monte [H2022] del valle [H6010];",
