      "33": "En el tercer [H7969] año [H8141] de Asa [H609] rey [H4428] de Juda [H3063], comenzo a reinar [H4427] Baasa [H1201] hijo [H1121] de Ahia [H281] sobre [H5921] todo [H3605] Israel [H3478] en Thirsa [H8656]; y reino veinticuatro [H6242] [H702] años [H8141].",
