      "9": "Los hijos [H1121] de Chûs [H3568]: Seba [H5434], Havila [H2341], Sabtha [H5454], Raema [H7484], y Sabtechâ [H5455]. Y los hijos [H1121] de Raema [H7484]: Seba [H7614] y Dedan [H1719].",
      "10": "Chûs [H3568] engendro [H3205] a Nimrod [H5248]: este [H1931] comenzo [H2490] a ser [H1961] poderoso [H1368] en la tierra [H776].",
      "11": "Misram [H4714] engendro [H3205] a Ludim [H3866], Ananim [H6047], Laabim [H3853], Nephtuim [H5320],",
      "12": "Phetrusim [H6625] y Casluim [H3695]: de estos [H8033] salieron [H3318] los Filisteos [H6430], y los Caphtoreos [H3732].",
      "13": "Canaan [H3667] engendro [H3205] a Sidon [H6721], su primogenito [H1060];",
