      "15": "Y al Heveo [H2340], y al Araceo [H6208], y al Sineo [H5513];",
      "16": "Al Aradeo [H721], y al Samareo [H6786], y al Hamatheo [H2577].",
      "17": "Los hijos [H1121] de Sem [H8035]: Elam [H5867], Assur [H804], Arphaxad [H775], Lud [H3865], Aram [H758], Hus [H5780], Hul [H2343], Gether [H1666], y Mesec [H4902].",
      "18": "Arphaxad [H775] engendro [H3205] a Sela [H7974], y Sela [H7974] engendro [H3205] a Heber [H5677].",
      "19": "Y a Heber [H5677] nacieron [H3205] dos [H8147] hijos [H1121]: el nombre [H8034] del uno [H259] fue Peleg [H6389], por [H3588] cuanto en sus dias [H3117] fue dividida [H6385] la tierra [H776]; y el nombre [H8034] de su hermano [H251] fue Joctan [H3355].",
      "20": "Y Joctan [H3355] engendro [H3205] a Elmodad [H486], Seleph [H8026], Asarmaveth [H2700], y Jera [H3392],",
      "21": "A Adoram [H1913] tambien, a Uzal [H187], Dicla [H1853],",
      "22": "Hebal [H5858], Abimael [H39], Seba [H7614],",
      "23": "Ophir [H211], Havila [H2341], y Jobab [H3103]: todos [H3605] hijos [H1121] de Joctan [H3355].",
      "24": "Sem [H8035], Arphaxad [H775], Sela [H7974],",
      "25": "Heber [H5677], Peleg [H6389], Reu [H7466],",
      "26": "Serug [H8286], Nachôr [H5152], Thare [H8646],",
      "27": "Y Abram [H87], el cual [H1931] es Abraham [H85].",
      "28": "Los hijos [H1121] de Abraham [H85]: Isaac [H3327] e Ismael [H3458].",
      "29": "Y estas son [H428] sus descendencias [H8435]: el primogenito [H1060] de Ismael [H3458], Nabajoth [H5032]; despues Cedar [H6938], Adbeel [H110], Misam [H4017],",
      "30": "Misma [H4927], Duma [H1746], Maasa [H4854], Hadad [H2301], Thema [H8485], Jetur [H3195], Naphis [H5305], y Cedma [H6929]. Estos [H428] son los hijos [H1121] de Ismael [H3458].",
      "31": "Y Cethura [H6989], concubina [H6370] de Abraham [H85], pario [H3205] a Zimram [H2175], Jocsan [H3370], Medan [H4091], Madian [H4080], Isbac [H3435], y a Sua [H7744].",
