      "10": "Y Johanan [H3110] engendro [H3205] a Azarias [H5838], el [H1931] que [H834] tuvo el [H1931] sacerdocio [H3547] en la casa [H1004] que [H834] Salomon [H8010] edifico [H1129] en Jerusalem [H3389];",
      "11": "Y Azarias [H5838] engendro [H3205] a Amarias [H568], y Amarias [H568] engendro [H3205] a Achîtob [H285];",
      "12": "Y Achîtob engendro [H3205] a Sadoc [H6659], y Sadoc [H6659] engendro [H3205] a Sallum [H7967];",
