      "38": "Y Micloth [H4732] engendro [H3205] a Samaan [H8043]. Y estos [H1992] habitaban [H3427] tambien [H637] en Jerusalem [H3389] con [H5973] sus [H1992] hermanos [H251] enfrente [H5048] de ellos [H1992].",
      "39": "Y Ner [H5369] engendro [H3205] a Cis [H7027], y Cis [H7027] engendro [H3205] a Saul [H7586], y Saul [H7586] engendro [H3205] a Jonathan [H3083], Malchîsua [H4444], Abinadab [H41], y Esbaal [H792].",
      "40": "E hijo [H1121] de Jonathan [H3083] fue Merib-baal [H4810], y Merib-baal [H4807] engendro [H3205] a Michâ [H4320].",
