      "6": "Lugar [H4725] hay cuyas piedras [H68] son zafiro [H5601], y sus polvos [H6083] de oro [H2091].",
      "7": "Senda [H5410] que nunca [H3808] la conocio [H3045] ave [H5861], ni [H3808] ojo [H5869] de buitre [H344] la vio [H7805]:",
