      "26": "Si [H518] he mirado [H7200] al sol [H216] cuando [H3588] resplandecia [H1984], y a la luna [H3394] cuando [H3588] iba [H1980] hermosa [H3368],",
      "27": "Y mi corazon [H3820] se engaño [H6601] en secreto [H5643], y mi boca [H6310] beso [H5401] mi mano [H3027]:",
