      "6": "Y respondio [H6030] Eliu [H453] hijo [H1121] de Barachêl [H1292], Bucita [H940], y dijo [H559]: Yo [H589] soy menor [H6810] de dias [H3117], y vosotros [H859] viejos [H3453]; he tenido por [H5921] tanto [H3651] miedo [H2119], y temido [H3372] declararos mi [H589] opinion [H1843].",
      "7": "Yo decia [H559]: Los dias [H3117] hablaran [H1696], y la muchedumbre [H7230] de años [H8141] declarara sabiduria [H3045].",
