      "13": "Por tanto, yo os hare echar [H2904] de [H5921] esta tierra [H776] a tierra [H776] que [H834] ni [H3808] vosotros [H859] ni [H3808] vuestros [H859] padres [H1] habeis conocido [H3045], y alla [H8033] servireis [H5647] a dioses [H430] ajenos [H312] de [H5921] dia [H3119] y de [H5921] noche [H3915]; porque [H834] no [H3808] os mostrare clemencia [H5414].",
