      "8": "Y dijome [H559]: Hijo [H1121] del hombre [H120], cava [H2864] ahora [H4994] en la pared [H7023]. Y cave [H2864] en la pared [H7023], y he aqui [H2009] una [H259] puerta [H6607].",
