      "13": "Por tanto [H3651], asi [H3541] ha dicho [H559] el Señor [H136] Jehova [H3069]: Yo tambien extendere [H5186] mi mano [H3027] sobre [H5921] Edom [H123], y talare [H3772] de [H4480] ella hombres [H120] y bestias [H929], y la asolare [H5414]: desde [H4480] Teman [H8487] y Dedan [H1719] caeran [H5307] a cuchillo [H2719].",
      "14": "Y pondre [H5414] mi venganza [H5360] en Edom [H123] por la mano [H3027] de mi pueblo [H5971] Israel [H3478]; y haran [H6213] en Edom [H123] segun mi enojo [H639] y segun mi ira [H2534]: y conoceran [H3045] mi venganza [H5360], dice [H5002] el Señor [H136] Jehova [H3069].",
