      "5": "Y alzome [H5375] el espiritu [H7307], y metiome [H935] en el atrio [H2691] de adentro [H6442]; y he aqui [H2009] que la gloria [H3519] de Jehova [H3068] hinchio [H4390] la casa [H1004].",
